# TaskFlow - Test Cases

## 1. Task Creation
- Test ID: TC-01
- Description: Create a task with valid data.
- Input: Valid task title and description.
- Expected Result: Task is created successfully (201).

## 2. Get Tasks
- Test ID: TC-02
- Description: Retrieve the list of tasks.
- Input: GET request to tasks endpoint.
- Expected Result: Server returns the task list (200).

## 3. Update Task
- Test ID: TC-03
- Description: Update an existing task.
- Input: Valid task ID and updated data.
- Expected Result: Task is updated successfully (200).

## 4. Delete Task
- Test ID: TC-04
- Description: Delete an existing task.
- Input: Valid task ID.
- Expected Result: Task is deleted successfully (200).

## 5. Invalid Input
- Test ID: TC-05
- Description: Submit invalid task data.
- Input: Missing or invalid required fields.
- Expected Result: Server returns a validation error (400).

## 6. Task Not Found
- Test ID: TC-06
- Description: Request a non-existing task.
- Input: Invalid task ID.
- Expected Result: Server returns 404.

## 7. Server Error Handling
- Test ID: TC-07
- Description: Handle unexpected server errors.
- Input: Simulated internal error.
- Expected Result: Server returns 500.
